---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>24</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --rose-deep: #c0637d;
      --gold:      #c9a96e;
      --ink:       #2d2d2d;
      --ink-soft:  #6b6b6b;
      --cream:     #fff8f9;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--ink);
      min-height: 100svh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 50% 0%, rgba(232,160,180,0.12) 0%, transparent 65%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 80% 100%, rgba(201,169,110,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 480px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 0.35em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--rose-deep);
      opacity: 0.55;
    }

    .title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 8vw, 3.8rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .title em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--rose-deep);
    }

    .watch-icon {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      opacity: 0.75;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .ornament {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.8rem;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 200px;
    }

    .ornament-line {
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(201,169,110,0.4));
    }

    .ornament-line:last-child {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(201,169,110,0.4), transparent);
    }

    .ornament-dot {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 0.5rem;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    .text {
      font-weight: 300;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      max-width: 340px;
    }

    .back-link {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(180,180,180,0.3);
      padding-bottom: 1px;
      opacity: 0.6;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .back-link:hover { opacity: 1; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">

    <p class="eyebrow">16 de junio · 2025</p>

    <h1 class="title">Cumpleaños <em>24</em></h1>

    <span class="watch-icon">⌚</span>

    <div class="ornament">
      <span class="ornament-line"></span>
      <span class="ornament-dot">◇</span>
      <span class="ornament-line"></span>
    </div>

    <p class="text">
      Este año el regalo fue uno que llevas puesto —
      para que cada vez que lo mires sepas que alguien
      pensó mucho en ti al elegirlo.
    </p>

    <a href="/" class="back-link">← volver</a>

  </main>
</body>
</html>
